---
/**
 * Hidden until it takes focus, then pinned to the top-left corner so a keyboard
 * reader can jump straight past the header.
 */
---
<a
  href="#main-content"
  class="sr-only focus-visible:not-sr-only focus-visible:fixed focus-visible:top-2 focus-visible:left-2 focus-visible:z-200 focus-visible:rounded-md focus-visible:bg-active focus-visible:px-4 focus-visible:py-2 focus-visible:text-sm focus-visible:font-medium focus-visible:text-active-foreground"
>
  Skip to content
</a>
